sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Người dùng
    participant M as main.py
    participant I as Inventory
    participant C as FactsCollector
    participant CM as ConnectionManager
    participant D as NetworkDevice (mỗi router)
    participant E as MonitoringEngine
    participant R as HtmlReport
    U->>M: python main.py scan
    M->>I: load() + filter() + build_devices()
    I-->>M: [MikroTikDevice, VyOSDevice, ...]
    M->>C: collect(devices)
    C->>CM: run(devices, get_facts)
    par mỗi thiết bị một luồng
        CM->>D: connect() (SSH)
        D->>D: get_facts(): gửi lệnh show, parse_*()
        D-->>CM: DeviceFacts hoặc lỗi (timeout, sai mật khẩu)
    end
    CM-->>C: List[TaskResult]
    C-->>M: facts, failures
    M->>E: evaluate(facts, failures)
    E->>E: load_previous() snapshot lần trước
    E->>E: chạy 5 luật AnomalyRule
    E-->>M: List[Alert] (đã sắp theo mức độ)
    M->>E: save_snapshot(facts)
    M->>C: to_json(), to_csv()
    M->>R: render(facts, failures, alerts)
    R-->>U: output/report.html
